    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "- PARRY WINDOW: 0.40s (~24 frames) on Right Click / Q.\n  Committed parry turns blow aside, shatters 45 Posture points,\n  inflicts hit-stop (0.14s) & world slow-motion (0.25s).\n\n- DEFLECT WINDOW: 0.38s (~23 frames) on timed Guard.\n  Negates all damage, deals 28 Posture damage, generates Focus.\n\n- BLOCK: Late hold absorbs hit with 15% chip damage & Posture loss.\n\n- POSTURE & RIPOSTE: Draining 100 boss Posture causes guard break.\n  Boss reels and kneels for 2.8s; strike within 2.8m for high-damage\n  Riposte / Execution (72 dmg, unparryable).\n\n- PERILOUS ATTACKS: Red Kanji / Telegraph = UNBLOCKABLE.\n  Completely bypasses Guard and Parry. Must Dodge or Jump!\n\n- JUMP MECHANICS: 7.5 m/s launch upward with aerial steering.\n  Physically clears low sweeps, ground slams, expanding shockwaves\n  and floor fire hazard fields.\n\n- RANGED & SHOCKWAVES: Standard shockwaves parryable with Right\n  Click or cleared by Jump/Dodge. Cataclysmic wave 8.5m radius.\n\n- FLOOR HAZARDS: 3 dmg/tick, ignores i-frames. Jump/exit fire."
