    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "- PLAYER WEAPONS:\n  * Balanced Blade:\n    - Light 1-3: Range 2.1m - 2.4m, 110\xB0-130\xB0 Arc\n    - Heavy Overhead: Range 2.8m, 42 dmg (3.5 m/s lunge)\n    - Whirlwind Special: Range 3.4m, 360\xB0 Sphere\n  * Greatsword (Hyper-Armour):\n    - Light 1-2: Range 2.7m - 2.9m, 140\xB0-150\xB0 Arc\n    - Earthbreaker: Range 3.0m, 56 dmg, Heavy Poise\n    - Seismic Special: Range 3.8m, 360\xB0 Sphere\n  * Energy Blade (Rapid Flurry):\n    - Light 1-4: Range 1.9m - 2.1m fast pokes\n    - Lunge Thrust: Range 3.4m Box, 30 dmg (8 m/s lunge)\n    - Blade Dance: Range 2.8m, 360\xB0 Sphere\n\n- BOSS MOVESET (7 Attacks):\n  * Jab: 3.0m reach (0.28s startup, 8 dmg)\n  * Wide Sweep: 4.0m reach, 120\xB0 arc (0.45s startup, 12 dmg)\n  * Ground Slam: 3.6m reach 360\xB0 + 3m fire hazard (8 dmg)\n  * Charge: 16 m/s lunge, ~12m effective reach (15 dmg)\n  * Perilous Overhead: 3.4m reach, Unblockable! (26 dmg)\n  * Shockwave: 7.0m projectile wave + 3.5m hazard (14 dmg)\n  * Cataclysmic Wave: 8.5m arena wave, Unblockable! (22 dmg)"
